	"FriendlyName": "Ars Electronica Futurelab - Pharus Tracking",
	"Description": "Pharus laser floor tracking for Unreal Engine: receives TrackLink UDP data, maps tracks onto the floor and spawns actors per track. GameInstance subsystem with INI configuration, global root origin, relative spawning and an nDisplay-safe actor pool.",
